    <string name="omni_about_policy_note">What this app keeps, and what it never sends</string>
    <string name="omni_about_policy_body">Your projects, your keys and your packages stay in this app’s own storage on this device. Nothing you write is uploaded, and the app opens no connection of its own. A link you tap is handed to whichever app you choose to open it with.</string>
    <string name="omni_about_terms">Terms of use</string>
    <string name="omni_about_terms_note">What you may do with what this builds</string>
    <string name="omni_about_terms_body">What you build here is yours. The app is given as it is, with no promise that a package it produces suits any purpose of yours. Signing keys are yours to keep safe: nobody, this app included, can recover one you lose.</string>
